00:08:00.946 --> 00:08:02.180
"Everything is great,

00:08:02.180 --> 00:08:04.749
and there's nothing
to be upset about."

00:08:04.749 --> 00:08:12.824
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:08:12.824 --> 00:08:13.992
And while some Republicans

00:08:13.992 --> 00:08:15.761
are desperate
to ignore the questions,

00:08:15.761 --> 00:08:17.596
others are urging Trump
to take a stand,

00:08:17.596 --> 00:08:20.032
like South Carolina Senator,
Lindsey Graham,

00:08:20.032 --> 00:08:21.934
who had this to say about Moore.

00:08:21.934 --> 00:08:24.403
-I met a lot of people
in the mall,

00:08:24.403 --> 00:08:26.004
and if you get kicked out
of the mall,

00:08:26.004 --> 00:08:29.208
that's a pretty bad situation
to find yourself in.

00:08:29.208 --> 00:08:30.209
[ Laughter ]

00:08:30.209 --> 00:08:32.144
I mean, I agree,
but why have you met

00:08:32.144 --> 00:08:34.212
a lot of people in the mall?

00:08:34.212 --> 00:08:36.815
"I got a booth.
It's called Lindsey's Nut Hut.

00:08:36.815 --> 00:08:39.619
It's mostly pecans.

00:08:39.619 --> 00:08:41.988
Those pecans
are as sweets as old Lindsey."

00:08:41.988 --> 00:08:43.455
[ Laughter ]

00:08:43.455 --> 00:08:47.626
This is a society-wide problem
borne out of systemic misogyny

00:08:47.626 --> 00:08:49.361
and abuse of power,
and both parties

00:08:49.361 --> 00:08:51.964
need to take it seriously,
no matter who's accused.

00:08:51.964 --> 00:08:54.633
Don't you agree,
Congressman Mo Brooks?

00:08:54.633 --> 00:08:55.768
[ Laughter ]

00:08:55.768 --> 00:08:57.469
This has been "A Closer Look."

00:08:57.469 --> 00:09:01.340
[ Cheers and applause ]

